  "design": {
    "enemySide": "north",
    "tacticalIdentity": "Assault a coastal storm-surge barrier and reclaimed polder network across the Scheldt Delta. Wide open estuary basins let hover packs and the amphibious Hydra MLRS-9 rocket cruiser strike from the water, while four dry causeways, sluice bridges, dune windbreaks, and destructible floodgate bulkheads give tracked armor covered approaches and flanking cuts.",
